# The resolver is itself a lock input: a floating `uv` makes
# `lock-deps-check` report resolver drift as source drift. Locking it
# is circular by nature -- `lock-deps` installs from a lock it is the
# only thing that writes -- which is fine once bootstrapped, and
# recoverable by running `lock-deps` with an unpinned `uv` if it is
# ever not.
uv
